    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Fly the wings of experience\nWe would like you to get to know us better. We are\nlines from 16 other countries entrust us with the instruction\nTAP-Air Portugal and you can find us throughout the world.\nof their own staff. Moreover, they have their aircraft over-\nFor we fly to more than 40 destinations on four continents\nhauled in our workshops.\nand we have 71 Offices at home and abroad waiting to ser-\nThirty-five years of experience has enabled us to per-\nfect our services, expand our routes and develop our capa-\nWe enjoy a well-deserved reputation for efficiency, re\nliability and experience around the globe. For we know\nwhat flying is all about. From the well-being and comfort of\nour passengers, to the maintenance of our aircraft, we are\namongst the best.\nFor not only do we train our pilots, together with the\nrest of the air and ground personnel, to the highest modern\ninternational standards at our own training school, but air-\ncity to meet the ever increasing and changing needs of our\nWe are there when and where you need us - the big\nairline of a small but beautiful country which is proud to re-\nceive you. So welcome aboard and experience the warm,\nfriendly, personal touch which is the hallmark of our servi-\nce. You will find that flying in our aircraft is pretty much like\nbeing at home.\nFly\nTEr\nAIR\nPORTUGAL\nThe friendliest way\nto discover the world",
